.Dd October 3, 2026
.Dt BASENAME 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm basename
.Nd strip directory and suffix components from path
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar path
.Op Ar suffix
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
strips the leading directory components from
.Ar path ,
and optionally removes
.Ar suffix
if present.
